<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SiGU - Error</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: 'class',
        }
    </script>
</head>
<body class="bg-[#f4f6f9] dark:bg-[#1e2a3a]">
    <!-- No incluimos layout_header aquí por si el error ocurre antes de tener sesión/usuario válido -->
    <div class="w-full min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="w-full max-w-md bg-white dark:bg-[#2a3a4d] p-8 rounded-lg shadow-md border-t-4 border-red-500 dark:border-red-600 text-center">
            
            <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-red-100 dark:bg-red-900/30 text-red-500 dark:text-red-400 mb-6">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-8 w-8" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" />
                </svg>
            </div>

            <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">¡Oops! Ha ocurrido un error.</h1>
            
            <div class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-8">
                {{#errorMessage}}
                    <p class="font-medium text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-900/10 p-3 rounded-md">{{errorMessage}}</p>
                {{/errorMessage}}
                {{^errorMessage}}
                    <p>Lo sentimos, algo salió mal en el sistema. Por favor, inténtalo de nuevo más tarde.</p>
                {{/errorMessage}}
            </div>

            <a href="/" class="inline-block bg-[#2471a3] text-white py-2 px-6 rounded-md hover:bg-[#1a5276] transition-colors duration-300 font-medium focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#2471a3] focus:ring-offset-2">
                ← Volver al inicio
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
